{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "epn8n-executions",
  "title": "n8n / Executions and Workflows",
  "tags": [
    "n8n"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "Data source",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {
          "text": "Prometheus",
          "value": "prometheus"
        },
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "job",
        "label": "Job",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(up, job)",
        "definition": "label_values(up, job)",
        "current": {
          "text": "n8n",
          "value": "n8n"
        },
        "options": [],
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false,
        "sort": 1,
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "instance",
        "label": "Instance",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(up{job=\"$job\"}, instance)",
        "definition": "label_values(up{job=\"$job\"}, instance)",
        "current": {
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        },
        "options": [],
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "sort": 1,
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Required n8n metric flags",
      "description": "Which optional n8n metric flags this dashboard depends on, and what goes missing when each one is off.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "Reads the n8n event-bus counters and the execution duration histogram. Flags needed on the n8n instance:\n\n- `N8N_METRICS_INCLUDE_MESSAGE_EVENT_BUS_METRICS`: all counter panels\n- `N8N_METRICS_INCLUDE_WORKFLOW_ID_LABEL`: per-workflow tables and p95\n- `N8N_METRICS_INCLUDE_WORKFLOW_INFO`: workflow names. The name lookup is an inner join, so without it the per-workflow panels are empty\n- `N8N_METRICS_INCLUDE_NODE_TYPE_LABEL`: node-type breakdown\n\nEvent-bus counters are created on first use and reset on n8n restart: an empty panel means the flag is off or the event has not fired since the last restart. `scripts/doctor.sh` reports which."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Execution outcomes",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Failure ratio (selected window)",
      "description": "Failed executions divided by started executions over the dashboard time range. An instance that has run executions and had none fail reads 0, even though n8n_workflow_failed_total does not exist until the first failure. No data means no execution started in the range, or N8N_METRICS_INCLUDE_MESSAGE_EVENT_BUS_METRICS is off.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 2,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.05
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.2
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "(sum(increase(n8n_workflow_failed_total{job=\"$job\", instance=~\"$instance\"}[$__range])) or vector(0)) / clamp_min(sum(increase(n8n_workflow_started_total{job=\"$job\", instance=~\"$instance\"}[$__range])), 1)",
          "legendFormat": "failure ratio",
          "instant": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Executions started (selected window)",
      "description": "Total workflow executions started over the dashboard time range, from increase() over $__range. The counter resets on n8n restart, so increase() rather than the raw counter is what makes this number survive a restart inside the window. Needs N8N_METRICS_INCLUDE_MESSAGE_EVENT_BUS_METRICS.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 5,
        "y": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(n8n_workflow_started_total{job=\"$job\", instance=~\"$instance\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "started",
          "instant": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Execution outcome rates",
      "description": "Started, succeeded, failed and cancelled executions per second, from the event bus counters through rate() over a 5m window. Needs N8N_METRICS_INCLUDE_MESSAGE_EVENT_BUS_METRICS. Started will not equal the sum of the other three while executions are still running.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 14,
        "x": 10,
        "y": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "decimals": 3,
          "min": 0,
          "mappings": [],
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "pointSize": 5,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            },
            "hideFrom": {
              "tooltip": false,
              "viz": false,
              "legend": false
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "failed"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "succeeded"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(n8n_workflow_started_total{job=\"$job\", instance=~\"$instance\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "started"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(n8n_workflow_success_total{job=\"$job\", instance=~\"$instance\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "succeeded"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(n8n_workflow_failed_total{job=\"$job\", instance=~\"$instance\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "failed"
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(n8n_workflow_cancelled_total{job=\"$job\", instance=~\"$instance\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "cancelled"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Failure ratio over time",
      "description": "Failed executions divided by started executions in a rolling 5m window. A window with executions and no failures draws 0 rather than a gap, because the failure counter is absent until the first failure. Windows with no executions at all draw nothing. Needs N8N_METRICS_INCLUDE_MESSAGE_EVENT_BUS_METRICS.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 3,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "mappings": [],
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 20,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "pointSize": 5,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            },
            "hideFrom": {
              "tooltip": false,
              "viz": false,
              "legend": false
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "red"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "(sum(increase(n8n_workflow_failed_total{job=\"$job\", instance=~\"$instance\"}[5m])) or vector(0)) / clamp_min(sum(increase(n8n_workflow_started_total{job=\"$job\", instance=~\"$instance\"}[5m])), 1)",
          "legendFormat": "failure ratio"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Executions by mode",
      "description": "Execution rate split by the mode label on the duration histogram, which separates manual runs in the editor from production runs triggered by webhooks, schedules and other triggers. This panel reads n8n_workflow_execution_duration_seconds_count, which is on by default under N8N_METRICS_INCLUDE_WORKFLOW_EXECUTION_DURATION, so it works even without the event bus counters.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 13
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "decimals": 3,
          "min": 0,
          "mappings": [],
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 20,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "pointSize": 5,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            },
            "hideFrom": {
              "tooltip": false,
              "viz": false,
              "legend": false
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (mode) (rate(n8n_workflow_execution_duration_seconds_count{job=\"$job\", instance=~\"$instance\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{mode}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Per-workflow breakdown",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Top 10 workflows by failures",
      "description": "Failed executions per workflow over the dashboard time range. The counters carry only workflow_id, so the query aggregates by workflow_id first and then multiplies by n8n_workflow_info with group_left (workflow_name); that join is what turns the opaque id into a readable name. It needs N8N_METRICS_INCLUDE_WORKFLOW_INFO (leader main only) for the name column and N8N_METRICS_INCLUDE_WORKFLOW_ID_LABEL for the id itself. With the info flag off the whole panel is empty, because the join drops every series that has no matching info sample.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "mappings": [],
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            },
            "inspect": false,
            "filterable": false
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Failures"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-text"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "color": "text",
                      "value": null
                    },
                    {
                      "color": "red",
                      "value": 1
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false,
          "reducer": [
            "sum"
          ],
          "countRows": false,
          "fields": ""
        },
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "Failures",
            "desc": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "workflow_name": 0,
              "workflow_id": 1,
              "Value": 2
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "workflow_name": "Workflow",
              "workflow_id": "Workflow id",
              "Value": "Failures"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "topk(10, sum by (workflow_id) (increase(n8n_workflow_failed_total{job=\"$job\", instance=~\"$instance\"}[$__range])) * on (workflow_id) group_left (workflow_name) n8n_workflow_info{job=\"$job\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{workflow_name}}",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Top 10 workflows by execution volume",
      "description": "Executions started per workflow over the dashboard time range, using the same label join as the failures table: aggregate by workflow_id, then multiply by n8n_workflow_info with group_left (workflow_name) to attach the name. Needs N8N_METRICS_INCLUDE_WORKFLOW_ID_LABEL and N8N_METRICS_INCLUDE_WORKFLOW_INFO.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 20
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "mappings": [],
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            },
            "inspect": false,
            "filterable": false
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false,
          "reducer": [
            "sum"
          ],
          "countRows": false,
          "fields": ""
        },
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "Executions",
            "desc": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "workflow_name": 0,
              "workflow_id": 1,
              "Value": 2
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "workflow_name": "Workflow",
              "workflow_id": "Workflow id",
              "Value": "Executions"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "topk(10, sum by (workflow_id) (increase(n8n_workflow_started_total{job=\"$job\", instance=~\"$instance\"}[$__range])) * on (workflow_id) group_left (workflow_name) n8n_workflow_info{job=\"$job\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{workflow_name}}",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "p95 execution duration by workflow",
      "description": "95th percentile execution duration per workflow from n8n_workflow_execution_duration_seconds. The histogram carries workflow_id only when N8N_METRICS_INCLUDE_WORKFLOW_ID_LABEL is on; without it every execution lands in one series. The sum by (le, workflow_id) before histogram_quantile is required, otherwise buckets from different instances are quantiled separately and the result is wrong. The trailing join against n8n_workflow_info replaces the id with the name and needs N8N_METRICS_INCLUDE_WORKFLOW_INFO. Only the ten slowest workflows are drawn.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 2,
          "min": 0,
          "mappings": [],
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "pointSize": 5,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            },
            "hideFrom": {
              "tooltip": false,
              "viz": false,
              "legend": false
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "topk(10, histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, workflow_id) (rate(n8n_workflow_execution_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"$job\", instance=~\"$instance\"}[5m]))) * on (workflow_id) group_left (workflow_name) n8n_workflow_info{job=\"$job\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{workflow_name}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Node activity",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 36
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Node started and finished rate",
      "description": "Individual node executions per second across all workflows. A sustained gap between started and finished means nodes are entering execution faster than they complete, which usually points at a slow external call inside a node. Needs N8N_METRICS_INCLUDE_MESSAGE_EVENT_BUS_METRICS.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 37
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "decimals": 3,
          "min": 0,
          "mappings": [],
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "pointSize": 5,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            },
            "hideFrom": {
              "tooltip": false,
              "viz": false,
              "legend": false
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(n8n_node_started_total{job=\"$job\", instance=~\"$instance\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "node started"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(n8n_node_finished_total{job=\"$job\", instance=~\"$instance\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "node finished"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
