      "description": "Node completions per second broken down by node type. The node_type label exists only when N8N_METRICS_INCLUDE_NODE_TYPE_LABEL is on; with the label off this panel shows a single series covering all node types. Also needs N8N_METRICS_INCLUDE_MESSAGE_EVENT_BUS_METRICS for the counter itself.",
      "datasource": {
